# Emitter pylon: projects the friendly field while powered by its grid. The Game layer overrides
# the live output every tick (0 when unpowered); authored Output/Reach are the powered values'
# defaults only. Spawned with its origin at half height (1.5) above the ground hit.
Prefab gameEmitter
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.3 0.85 1
		Scale 1
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1 1
	Component Force
		Team 0
		Output 1.2
		Reach 12
		Centered true
		Direction 0 1 0
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 1
